-I believe, if my memory serves,

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:31.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're talking about the video
to "Romancing the Stone."

00:05:31.898 --> 00:05:33.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Billy Ocean music video.
-Yeah.

00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:36.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
Billy Ocean, yeah.
Michael's pop video.

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:39.205 size:88% position:44%
