00:05:55.188 --> 00:05:57.190 size:81% position:41%
And so, for Michael,
it's just always like,

00:05:57.190 --> 00:06:00.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Yeah, that was my --
when I did my music video.

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:03.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
